# Contact form submit endpoint
# Set this to the URL of your SiteGround (or other) mail handler that
# accepts a multipart/form-data POST with these fields:
#   name, company, email, phone, country, volume, message, consent, website
# (the "website" field is a honeypot — should be empty for legitimate submissions)
#
# If this variable is unset or empty, the contact form gracefully falls back
# to a mailto:support@muggleship.com link with the form data pre-filled in the body.
NEXT_PUBLIC_CONTACT_FORM_ACTION=
